                                                "text": "stage of immaturity"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d74718e6-2291-47fc-a0b1-13dac6794be4",
                                                "sense_id": "a3c7e41b-5a3b-3320-abc2-46b72bf70123",
                                                "text": "His constant joking showed his immaturity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c9e3b731-711e-40c8-a7e0-20db595369dd",
                                                "sense_id": "a3c7e41b-5a3b-3320-abc2-46b72bf70123",
                                                "text": "The plant’s immaturity made it sensitive to frost."
